<workout_file>
  <author>Xtri training coach</author>
  <name>S01 Teknikk A</name>
  <description>Drill + aerob. RPE 3-5. — Swim: Power = fraction of threshold SWIM pace (T-pace/CSS). Set swim threshold pace in TP Zones — not bike FTP. Import via Workout Builder (structured swim), not bulk ZWO.</description>
